{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to Mammon Systems, Technician.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your first day as a Tier 1 Vending Machine Specialist begins now.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880210/extras/06f86a24ee17425105aaf4414c87684c.poster.avif?t=1763559333\" width=480 height=134 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880210/extras/06f86a24ee17425105aaf4414c87684c.webm?t=1763559333\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880210/extras/06f86a24ee17425105aaf4414c87684c.mp4?t=1763559333\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Vending Machine</strong> is a survival horror game where you must evade and escape from a hostile anomalous vending machine by locating and inserting coins into eight vending machines scattered throughout the containment zone.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vending Machine Horror:</strong> Dr. [REDACTED] initially described the entity as a \u201cgoofy-ahh vending unit,\u201d but later retracted the statement after it sprinted at him full speed during an attempt to record \u201ccontent for his chat,\u201d as per his post-incident statement.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enter the Simulated Containment Zone: </strong>Our scientists and engineers have built a fake human city to contain these vending machines. Your job as a certified technician is to keep them satiated and satisfied by inserting coins into their slot.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Anomalous Entities:</strong> Between the bloodthirsty beverage dispenser and a disfigured, screaming humanoid thingy, you\u2019ll have more than just routine maintenance  to worry about.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stealth Gameplay: </strong>Turn off your flashlight. Listen closely. Use your spatial awareness to slip past hostile machines undetected in pitch darkness.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stay on the Move:</strong> Keep moving and weaving between obstacles to throw off your pursuers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Escape:\u00a0</strong>Once your objectives are complete, make a break for the exit. Do it fast.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880210/extras/51cf52c22a14f3b89492463c6fb9189c.poster.avif?t=1763559333\" width=480 height=134 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880210/extras/51cf52c22a14f3b89492463c6fb9189c.webm?t=1763559333\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880210/extras/51cf52c22a14f3b89492463c6fb9189c.mp4?t=1763559333\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The Final Dispense","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3880210/b0aa5d62da035900f413319cbae8a8e0e7ce221a.jpg"},{"name":"Welcome to the Facility","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3880210/3abb458261e7841d22cf56c8bd00aedd48a63871.jpg"},{"name":"World's Hardest Achievement","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3880210/99b04c0b3b8b98d6e23f4c4a037a73ae90bee0ab.jpg"},{"name":"One Drink Too Many","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3880210/d4651a5e1ce05da8451442b74594c8ce49d175c0.jpg"}],"total":4},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3880210?t=1763559333","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3880210?t=1763559333","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880210/de2711ba32bbfbd6303301b7cd514baa48b0e206/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763559333","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880210/de2711ba32bbfbd6303301b7cd514baa48b0e206/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763559333","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to Mammon Systems, Technician.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your first day as a Tier 1 Vending Machine Specialist begins now.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880210/extras/06f86a24ee17425105aaf4414c87684c.poster.avif?t=1763559333\" width=480 height=134 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880210/extras/06f86a24ee17425105aaf4414c87684c.webm?t=1763559333\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880210/extras/06f86a24ee17425105aaf4414c87684c.mp4?t=1763559333\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Vending Machine</strong> is a survival horror game where you must evade and escape from a hostile anomalous vending machine by locating and inserting coins into eight vending machines scattered throughout the containment zone.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vending Machine Horror:</strong> Dr. [REDACTED] initially described the entity as a \u201cgoofy-ahh vending unit,\u201d but later retracted the statement after it sprinted at him full speed during an attempt to record \u201ccontent for his chat,\u201d as per his post-incident statement.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enter the Simulated Containment Zone: </strong>Our scientists and engineers have built a fake human city to contain these vending machines. Your job as a certified technician is to keep them satiated and satisfied by inserting coins into their slot.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Anomalous Entities:</strong> Between the bloodthirsty beverage dispenser and a disfigured, screaming humanoid thingy, you\u2019ll have more than just routine maintenance  to worry about.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stealth Gameplay: </strong>Turn off your flashlight. Listen closely. Use your spatial awareness to slip past hostile machines undetected in pitch darkness.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stay on the Move:</strong> Keep moving and weaving between obstacles to throw off your pursuers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Escape:\u00a0</strong>Once your objectives are complete, make a break for the exit. Do it fast.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880210/extras/51cf52c22a14f3b89492463c6fb9189c.poster.avif?t=1763559333\" width=480 height=134 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880210/extras/51cf52c22a14f3b89492463c6fb9189c.webm?t=1763559333\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880210/extras/51cf52c22a14f3b89492463c6fb9189c.mp4?t=1763559333\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p>","developers":["Nookinya","Guildmaster Rin"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880210/e022c17e11fc1bbb1f9239b75c02f67a633a53ac/header.jpg?t=1763559333","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3880210/810745353/a24eebd86026f0f844875b1e036738f4a86450e2/1752793661/dash_av1.mpd?t=1752887821","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3880210/810745353/a24eebd86026f0f844875b1e036738f4a86450e2/1752793661/dash_h264.mpd?t=1752887821","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3880210/810745353/a24eebd86026f0f844875b1e036738f4a86450e2/1752793661/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1752887821","id":257170519,"name":"Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257170519/0971f54c355e7407b52287ee0c052d015722de96/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1752887821"}],"name":"The Vending Machine","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text":"The Vending Machine - $3.99 USD","packageid":1363950,"percent_savings":0,"percent_savings_text":" ","price_in_cents_with_discount":399}],"title":"Buy The Vending Machine"}],"packages":[1363950],"pc_requirements":{"min